{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CX42Y3BuBE1794576360.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>米埔自然護理區兩個環境樣本，驗出H5禽流感病毒。<br/></p><p>漁護署周四接獲香港大學通知，轄下公共衞生學院研究團隊定期監測，收集兩個環境樣本，確認驗出帶有H5病毒。</p><p><br/>收集樣本地點三公里範圍內，沒有雞場，漁護署正密切監察護理區內雀鳥的情況，並加強禽流感監控工作，密切留意本地活家禽農場及批發市場的情況。而世界自然基金會香港分會，已加強清潔及消毒，觀鳥屋及浮橋等遊客設施。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.790531+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:04.046320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:16:01.604689+00:00","content_hash":"c1b25c42324a70333c0a8b0eda909254b33294fe3ba46973e794f5b432a713f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.790531+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}